# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No data in this repository: databases, original source files, local stores and ASCII exports stay local
# (third-party data such as LXCat or NIST must not be redistributed). Synthetic test fixtures are the only exception.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.h5
*.hdf5
store/
sources/
tables/
# Plots and review images (piclas-db plot, reservoir, extract) show third-party data
*.png
*.jpg
# Papers are copyrighted, extracted and exported data belong in the private store
*.pdf
*.csv
# Exception for synthetic test fixtures; must stay last, later patterns override earlier ones
!tests/fixtures/**
